Use writable owner Data for iPadOS swap after the mount is ready.

Adapt UniXNU 007356dc for iPadOS, which already uses /private/var/vm.
Keep compressor initialization in place. Defer backing-file creation and
the freezer's temporary file probe until the verified Data mount has a
vm directory, including on existing Data installs.

